                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Good old-fashioned masocore.\n\nAmpu-Tea is quite possibly the most realistic tea-making simulator ever created. It accurately demonstrates that making a proper cup of tea is not merely a household chore, but an advanced exercise in robotics, spatial reasoning, patience, and the gradual abandonment of one's sanity.\n\nSo next time you order tea somewhere and find yourself outraged that it has taken an entire hour to arrive, play Ampu-Tea. You may discover that, actually, the poor bastard making it is doing remarkably well.",
